    "snippet": {
      "publishedAt": "2020-04-17T19:03:00.000Z",
      "channelId": "UCvqbFHwN-nwalWPjPUKpvTA",
      "title": "Webinar: Announcing Open Source gRPC Kotlin",
      "description": "As developers work to modernize applications, they need foundational tools that are simple and scalable. Kotlin is now the second most popular JVM-based programming language and enables developers to build everything from mobile apps to cloud microservices. To help developers modernize with Kotlin, we’ve open-sourced gRPC Kotlin. This session will introduce the project and walk through how to use it.\n\nPresenter:\n\nJames Ward, Developer Advocate @Google Cloud Platform",
